le=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:consolas,&quot;liberation mono&quot;,menlo,courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-width:0px 1px 0px 0px\"></td><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:consolas,&quot;liberation mono&quot;,menlo,courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">                } <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">else</span> {</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:consolas,&quot;liberation mono&quot;,menlo,courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-width:0px 1px 0px 0px\"></td><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:consolas,&quot;liberation mono&quot;,menlo,courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">                    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">indices</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>cfi<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">t1</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">/</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">t2</span></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:consolas,&quot;liberation mono&quot;,menlo,courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-width:0px 1px 0px 0px\"></td><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:consolas,&quot;liberation mono&quot;,menlo,courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">                }</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Wed, 9 Nov 2016 at 19:50 Chester Kam &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">chest...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Yves,<div><br></div><div>I wonder if you have any documentation on the calculation of fit indices in the lavaan programme. Particularly, we want to know how lavaan calculates CFI, because different calculation formulas may give slightly different values. We are looking at the values of CFI under extreme conditions.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you very much!</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Chester</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;lavaan&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lavaan+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/grou